OL,3,AFarmer who called 999 saw 'large group
OL,4,Aof hooded and masked men' near RAF
OL,5,AFairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FRAF Fairford, in the Cotswolds, is used
OL,8,Fby the US military. President Trump
OL,9,Fsays the US had the five men "under
OL,10,Fview for a long time, and we got them"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
