OL,3,AMore questions than answers after major
OL,4,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FRAF Fairford is a slice of America in
OL,7,Fthe heart of England; a forward
OL,8,Foperating base for the US Air Force
OL,9,Fsince the Cold War.
OL,11,FIts two-mile runway is so long it was
OL,12,Fonce an emergency backup for the US
OL,13,Fspace shuttle programme.
OL,15,FNow it is a vital launchpad for the
OL,16,Fvast, lumbering bombers President
OL,17,FDonald Trump uses to strike Iran, the
OL,18,Fonly airbase with such capabilities
OL,19,Favailable to the US in Europe.
OL,21,FAnd that ` by definition ` has long
OL,22,Fmade it a potential target.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
